sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Chat UI
    participant A1 as Agent (Lambda instance A)
    participant A2 as Agent (Lambda instance B)
    participant CH as Chats (DynamoDB)
    participant LLM as OpenAI

    User->>UI: Turn 1 "Create a post called Hello"
    UI->>A1: POST /chat {message}
    A1-->>UI: SSE conversation {id: c42}
    A1->>CH: GetItem c42 (empty)
    Note over A1: tools run (as in use case 3)
    A1->>CH: PutItem c42 [human, ai + tool calls, tool results, ai]
    A1-->>UI: SSE done

    User->>UI: Turn 2 "What was its title?"
    UI->>A2: POST /chat {message, conversation_id: c42}
    A2->>CH: GetItem c42
    CH-->>A2: earlier messages
    A2->>LLM: earlier messages + new question
    LLM-->>A2: "It was called Hello" (no tools needed)
    A2->>CH: PutItem c42 (history + this turn)
    A2-->>UI: tokens, done

    User->>UI: New chat
    UI->>A2: DELETE /chat/c42
    A2->>CH: DeleteItem c42
